{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e09-scene-04",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "到演播现场清静清静  (Peace and Quiet on the Studio Floor)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "crew": "场务"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "On the studio floor, Kaiwen is surprised to find Chun Yuqiao helping the crew move equipment right after leaving the hospital. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "您放这儿，我来吧，我给您搭把手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，您这刚出院，怎么突然跑到现场来干体力活儿了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "总编室那边被抗议的人快踏破门槛了，我上这儿来清静清静。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "也是，公司的高层肯定不会往这儿跑。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "其实林姐她们对你是一片真心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不管她们嘴上说什么，心里绝对是信任你、佩服你的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "上次的事情，真是对不起啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "蛋糕的事，我不该随便发火。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那样辜负了大家的心意，你帮我跟大伙说声抱歉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "别呀老大，您这话说的，本身也是我们不靠谱，该骂。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "饭到了，开饭了，大伙午休吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，您的饭我也一块儿订了，您先歇会儿吃一口。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "好的，谢谢你。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "您放这儿，我来吧，我给您搭把手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Set it down here; let me take it and lend you a hand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，您这刚出院，怎么突然跑到现场来干体力活儿了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, you just left the hospital; why did you suddenly come to the set to do heavy labour?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "总编室那边被抗议的人快踏破门槛了，我上这儿来清静清静。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Protesters have nearly worn down the threshold of the editorial office, so I came here for some peace and quiet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "也是，公司的高层肯定不会往这儿跑。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'True enough; senior company executives definitely will not come running down here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "其实林姐她们对你是一片真心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Actually, Lin Jie and the others are completely devoted to you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不管她们嘴上说什么，心里绝对是信任你、佩服你的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No matter what they say aloud, at heart they definitely trust and admire you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "上次的事情，真是对不起啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'About last time, I am truly sorry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "蛋糕的事，我不该随便发火。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Over that cake incident, I should not have lost my temper so carelessly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那样辜负了大家的心意，你帮我跟大伙说声抱歉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Acting like that let down everyone's goodwill; please tell the crew I am sorry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "别呀老大，您这话说的，本身也是我们不靠谱，该骂。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not say that, boss; we were the unreliable ones in the first place and deserved a scolding.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "饭到了，开饭了，大伙午休吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Lunch is here, time to eat; everyone take your lunch break!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，您的饭我也一块儿订了，您先歇会儿吃一口。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, I ordered your meal along with ours; rest a bit and have a bite.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "好的，谢谢你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, thank you.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "您放这儿，我来吧，我给您搭把手。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，您这刚出院，怎么突然跑到现场来干体力活儿了？",
      "gap": 0.5
